ethods/iec-60287#原理","content":"$d_{pk}$ 为两缆中心距离，$d'_{pk}$ 为电缆 $p$ 到电缆 $k$ 关于地表的镜像的距离，$W_k$ 为电缆 $k$ 的总损耗。电阻随温度变化，温度与损耗迭代至收敛。"},"25":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"单芯电缆，以及各芯有独立屏蔽的三芯电缆；直埋、排管和单一矩形回填区；多回路互热。"},"26":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"金属套损耗：两端接地的环流、单点接地与交叉互联的涡流；磁性钢带、钢丝铠装损耗；皱纹铝护套（须声明间隙有效热阻率及来源）。"},"27":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"交叉热源降额、IEC 60853 应急额定（给定有来源的阶跃响应）、CIGRE TB 880 参考链。"},"28":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"不支持：分层土壤、多种介质分区、土壤干燥区、架空与空气中敷设。单芯多回路的电损耗只在完整平衡三相单回路或已验证的双回平排分支中自动计算，其他排列须给出外部损耗系数及其来源。"},"29":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"型号：各层尺寸与材料、导体 R₂₀、温度系数、绝缘介电常数与介质损耗因数等，全部带来源。"},"30":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"敷设：埋深、排列与间距、排管或回填几何、金属套接地方式。"},"31":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"环境：地表温度、土壤（回填）热阻率。"},"32":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"设计准则：导体允许温度。"},"33":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"缺少任何必需输入时，运行前预检会指出缺哪一项，不会用默认值代替。"},"34":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#验证依据与限制","content":"以下为 `steady-rating` 能力的清单内容；其他能力（应急额定、TB 880 参考链、三芯工程参数推导等）见方法清单。逐项依据、工程算例和核对表见IEC 60287 逐项依据与算例。"},"35":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#验证依据与限制","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.iec60287\" />"},"36":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"page","content":"电缆厂：从结构表到正式规格书","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","快速上手"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory"},"37":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-0","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"导入厂家结构表，逐项核对来源与标准尺寸，按统一工况批量算出载流量，再生成规格书。"},"38":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-1","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#1-打开结构表导入页","content":"1. 打开结构表导入页"},"39":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-2","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"2. 上传结构表并选择工作表"},"40":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-3","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#3-确认列映射","content":"3. 确认列映射"},"41":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-4","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#4-填写系列声明","content":"4. 填写系列声明"},"42":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-5","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#5-核对入库预览","content":"5. 核对入库预览"},"43":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-6","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#6-确认入库","content":"6. 确认入库"},"44":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-7","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#7-批量标准核对","content":"7. 批量标准核对"},"45":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-8","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"8. 批量计算载流量"},"46":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-9","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#9-查看单个规格的载流量表","content":"9. 查看单个规格的载流量表"},"47":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-10","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"10. 生成规格书"},"48":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-11","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"接下来"},"49":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-12","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"本篇用随软件提供的人民电缆公开结构表（YJV22-8.7/15 kV 三芯钢带铠装），按真实操作走完电缆厂技术部最常用的一条线：**导入厂家结构表 → 核对 → 载流量表 → 正式规格书**，约 15 分钟。截图来自随安装包提供的示例库，数值都是软件实际算出来的。"},"50":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-13","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"开始前，按下载与安装启动 CableSimPro。"},"51":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-14","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#1-打开结构表导入页","content":"在浏览器地址栏打开 `http://127.0.0.1:8100/resources/cables/structure-import`（地址和端口换成你的服务地址）。这一页是“电缆型号库 · 结构表导入与系列”，上方有“导入结构表、系列与规格、公开样本对照、材料与环境、数据交换”几个标签，导入分五步：选择文件、选择工作表、列映射、系列声明、预览入库。"},"52":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-15","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#1-打开结构表导入页","content":"<Callout>当前版本侧栏还没有这一页的入口，需要直接输入地址。</Callout>"},"53":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-16","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"在“公开样本”里点 **下载人民电缆示例结构表**。导入自己的表时跳过这一步。"},"54":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-17","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"点 **选择结构表文件**，选中要导入的文件。支持 `.xlsx`、`.xls`、`.csv`，单个文件不超过 10 MiB，每行一个规格。"},"55":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-18","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"文件里有多张表时，在 **工作表** 下拉框里选要导入的那张，本例选“表3 YJV22”。下方列出每一列的列名和示例值，用来确认选对了表。"},"56":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-19","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"点 **确认工作表，设置列映射**。"},"57":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-20","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#3-确认列映射","content":"软件按列名自动对应目标字段和单位，本例 8 列已经对应。逐列检查右侧的“目标字段与单位”，原表单位不同就在下拉框里改选；“数据起始行”是数据开始的行号。常用的映射可以起名保存，下次在“复用已保存映射”里直接选用。"},"58":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-21","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#3-确认列映射","content":"确认后点 **填写系列声明**。"},"59":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-22","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#4-填写系列声明","content":"系列声明记录这批数据的身份：系列名称、制造商、型号、额定电压、芯数、数据身份和各层材料。页面顶部自动带出原表出处（手册名称、表号和页码）。本例把系列名称改为“人民电器 YJV22-8.7/15 kV 三芯（快速上手）”，其余保持默认。"},"60":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-23","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#4-填写系列声明","content":"点 **逐行校验并预览**。"},"61":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-24","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#5-核对入库预览","content":"预览逐行标出每个规格是“可入库”“缺项”还是“错误”：缺项的规格可以先保存为草稿，但缺少必需数据就不能计算；有错误的行必须更正或明确排除，否则不能入库。本例 11 行全部可入库。原表没有电阻列的规格，导体电阻取 GB/T 3956—2008 表 2 的标准上限，并注明这不是厂家实测值。"},"62":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-25","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#5-核对入库预览","content":"点规格名，可以逐项查看这一行每个数值的来源：原表位置、换算方法版本和可信分档。原表没有列出、按同电压等级公开资料补充的数值（如导体屏蔽厚度）会写明出处，不会冒充厂家数据。"},"63":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-26","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#6-确认入库","content":"在预览页底部核对“执行标准版本与来源”，勾选 **确认来源与系列声明**，点 **确认入库 11 个规格**。规格以“草稿 · 待人工核对”的状态进入电缆型号库，都是第 1 版；计算和人工审核在后面分别进行。"},"64":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-27","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#7-批量标准核对","content":"点 **打开系列，核对与计算** 进入系列页，勾选“选择全部规格”，点 **批量核对**，在对话框里勾选“确认所选规格与版本”后执行。每个规格都保存一次真实的产品标准尺寸核对运行，结果列出符合项、缺项和依据库尚未收录的项；标准是否符合与人工是否批准分开判断。"},"65":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-28","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"仍在系列页，点 **批量计算**，填写统一的计算工况，并在“工况来源”“方法参数来源”里写明每个取值的出处。本例取值如下："},"66":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-29","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值     |\n| ---- | -------- |\n| 工况名称 | 公开样本直埋条件 |","table":"table-0"},"67":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-30","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值             |\n| ---- | ---------------- |\n| 中心埋深 | 0.7 m（原表未列，明确声明） |","table":"table-0"},"68":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-31","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目    | 本例取值      |\n| ----- | --------- |\n| 土壤热阻率 | 1.0 K·m/W |","table":"table-0"},"69":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-32","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值  |\n| ---- | ----- |\n| 环境温度 | 25 °C |","table":"table-0"},"70":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-33","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值  |\n| ---- | ----- |\n| 交流频率 | 50 Hz |","table":"table-0"},"71":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-34","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目    | 本例取值 |\n| ----- | ---- |\n| 金属套接地 | 两端接地 |","table":"table-0"},"72":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-35","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目     | 本例取值 |\n| ------ | ---- |\n| 护套涡流损耗 | 明确忽略 |","table":"table-0"},"73":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-36","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目     | 本例取值 |\n| ------ | ---- |\n| 土壤热阻公式 | 精确式  |","table":"table-0"},"74":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-37","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目                  | 本例取值  |\n| ------------------- | ----- |\n| 集肤 / 邻近效应系数 kₛ / kₚ | 1 / 1 |","table":"table-0"},"75":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-38","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值                                    |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 求解控制 | 护套初始温度 70 °C，电流收敛容差 1×10⁻⁸ A，最多 300 次迭代 |","table":"table-0"},"76":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-39","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"勾选确认后执行。本例 10 个规格算出了直埋载流量；**3×50 被拒算**：它的填充与内衬厚度和芯外径之比超出 IEC 60287 图 6 的适用范围，软件写明原因，不硬算。"},"77":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-40","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#9-查看单个规格的载流量表","content":"在系列页 3×240 这一行点 **打开型号设计**，左侧选 **载流量表**。刚才的工况已作为一条“已计算”的工况保存；点 **添加工况** 可以加入不同的埋深、热阻率或敷设方式，再点 **计算所选工况**，形成完整的型号载流量表。"},"78":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-41","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"工具栏点 **规格书**，再点 **生成规格书**。生成时按需补算结构、电气参数、载流量、短路容量和标准核对五部分结果，已完成的计算会保留。"},"79":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-42","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"公开样本只有结构尺寸，没有材料密度、出厂实测值等资料，所以本例提示“结构推导：结构外径或用料缺少完整输入”，并给出阻止发布的项数："},"80":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-43","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"“审核与发布”页把阻止发布的项分成四类：需要工程师补输入、需要出厂实测值、标准依据未覆盖、人工确认关口。逐项补齐后重新生成，再依次 **采纳为版本草稿 → 提交评审 → 批准**；发布后，“生成规格书”按钮变为 **导出 PDF**。"},"81":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-44","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"资料完整的型号可以直接生成。示例库里的“YJV22-8.7/15 3×300”（规格书演示）已补齐结构和材料，点 **生成规格书** 后浏览器直接下载 PDF。下图是该文件中载流量章节的一页；未批准发布前，页眉标明编制草稿。"},"82":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-45","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"<Callout type=\"warn\">不要为了让规格书生成而填入估计值。缺项应来自厂家实测、图纸或有出处的标准，并在来源里写清楚。</Callout>"},"83":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-46","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"结构表导入、系列批量操作与改版：型号库与结构表导入"},"84":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-47","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"型号设计各部分与规格书审核发布：型号设计"},"85":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-48","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"规格书、载流量表、计算书和研究报告：正式交付文件"},"86":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"page","content":"研究院：从新建工程到计算书","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","快速上手"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research"},"87":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-0","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"新建工程，做 110 kV 电缆直埋载流量研究，改土壤热阻率后对比两次结果，生成并下载计算书。"},"88":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-1","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"1. 新建研究，同时新建工程"},"89":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-2","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#2-核对直埋敷设和工况","content":"2. 核对直埋敷设和工况"},"90":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-3","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"3. 预检并运行"},"91":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-4","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"4. 改条件再算一次"},"92":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-5","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#5-对比两次运行","content":"5. 对比两次运行"},"93":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-6","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#6-生成计算书","content":"6. 生成计算书"},"94":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-7","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"接下来"},"95":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-8","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"本篇按真实操作走完研究院最常用的一条线：**新建工程 → 直埋载流量研究 → 改条件对比 → 计算书**，约 10 分钟。截图来自随安装包提供的示例库，数值都是软件实际算出来的。"},"96":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-9","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"开始前，按下载与安装启动 CableSimPro，用浏览器打开首页。示例使用“YJQ02-64/110 kV · 1×800（典型结构演示）”电缆，这是一根结构完整、用于演示的 110 kV 铅护套电缆。"},"97":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-10","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"点首页右上角的 **新建研究**。"},"98":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-11","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"在对话框里依次选择："},"99":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-12","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**所属工程**：保持“新建工程”，系统会为这次研究新建一个工程；"},"100":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-13","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**研究任务**：额定载流量；"},"101":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-14","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**研究名称**：直埋载流量；"},"102":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-15","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**引用型号版本**：YJQ02-64/110 kV · 1×800（典型结构演示） · 1.0.1；"},"103":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-16","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**计算方法**：IEC 60287 载流量 · 地下稳态。"},"104":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-17","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"点 **建立研究**。"},"105":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-18","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"型号版本在研究里是固定引用：之后型号库里出现新版本，这个研究仍按选定的版本计算，除非你主动更换。"},"106":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-19","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#2-核对直埋敷设和工况","content":"研究页中间是敷设截面：直埋单回、品字形排列，中心埋深 0.752 m。右侧“输入”页列出工况：回路电流 350 A、地表温度 25.0 °C、介质（土壤）热阻率 1.00 K·m/W、导体温限 90.0 °C。输入旁的来源标记说明数值是工程师填写还是由计算得出；改动后要保存才会参与计算。"},"107":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-20","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"点工具栏上的 **预检并运行**。运行前预检会检查输入是否完整、工况是否在方法适用范围内，并说明这次在本机还是超算上求解。"},"108":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-21","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"如果某一项超出方法范围或缺少必需参数，预检会逐条写明原因，**确认并运行** 按钮不可用。软件不会自己估一个值替你算下去。"},"109":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-22","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"确认无误后点 **确认并运行**，几秒后结果出现在研究页顶部。本例在 90.0 °C 温限下的允许电流为 944.8 A；按 350 A 运行时最热导体 33.5 °C，距温限还有 56.5 K。"},"110":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-23","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"在右侧“输入”页把 **介质热阻率** 改为 1.5 K·m/W，点工具栏的 **保存修改**。"},"111":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-24","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"再次 **预检并运行**，确认后运行。"},"112":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-25","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"土壤热阻率变大后散热变差，本例允许电流降到 801.1 A。第一次的结果仍然保存着，研究里标为历史结果，不会被覆盖。"},"113":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-26","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#5-对比两次运行","content":"点结果区右上角的 **运行记录**，勾选刚才的两次运行，点 **对比所选运行**。对比表分组列出两次运行的差别，展开“输入差异（SI）”可以看到这次改动的是土壤热阻率；“限制对象”说明两次都是同一根电缆先达到温限。"},"114":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-27","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#6-生成计算书","content":"点工具栏的 **生成计算书**。计算书只引用你选定的、已经保存的运行，不会重新计算；“来源”页列出它引用的运行、宿主对结果一致性的校验和所用方法版本，便于审核时逐项追溯。"},"115":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-28","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#6-生成计算书","content":"在“预览”页点 **下载 PDF**，得到客户版计算书。下图是本例下载文件的首页："},"116":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-29","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"研究里的工况、敷设模板、参数扫描和结果口径，见载流量研究。"},"117":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-30","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"IEC 60287 的原理、适用范围和验证依据，见IEC 60287 稳态载流量。"},"118":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-31","page_id":"/docs/quicks